{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118186","id":3488990458,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7P9cT6","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118186","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118186.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118186.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118186","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118186/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118186/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118186/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/3d8ab757d54ca410afaf2494c38206946cd42c2c","number":118186,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"GDScript: Use linked list for instance tracking.","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Each `GDScript` does bookkeeping about its instances, this is primarily used for hot reloading purposes (but #118191 requires it in prod builds).\r\n\r\nAt the moment this is done using an `RBSet`, however this becomes a bottleneck when instancing a lot of objects. The only case for searching in the set was the implementation of `Script::instance_has` which is not used internally and can be implemented by just looking at the passed object. So we don't need efficient searching and can use a linked list (`SelfList`) to get O(1) insertion and deletion.\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Benchmarked using this script</summary>\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends Node\r\n\r\nclass Test extends Object:\r\n\tpass\r\n\r\nconst RUNS = 50\r\nconst OBJ_COUNT = 100_000\r\n\r\n# Called when the node enters the scene tree for the first time.\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tseed(\"El psy kongroo\".hash())\r\n\tvar t = Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\tfor run in range(RUNS):\r\n\t\tvar instances: Array[Object] = []\r\n\t\tfor i in range(OBJ_COUNT):\r\n\t\t\tinstances.append(Test.new())\r\n\t\tinstances.shuffle()\r\n\t\tfor i in instances:\r\n\t\t\ti.free()\r\n\tprint (Time.get_ticks_msec() - t)\r\n\tget_tree().quit(0)\r\n```\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nI'm seeing almost a 40% increase in performance with this change. I also checked `HashSet` just in case, and while it outperforms `RBSet` it is still slower than the linked list approach.\r\n\r\nDatesheet: [self_list.ods](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26481037/self_list.ods)\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nOnly downside: this adds 32bytes to each `GDScriptInstance`, but this seems like a fine tradeoff to me. We could get it down to 16bytes by not using `SelfList` and implementing this manually, directly on `GDScriptInstance`. Which would remove the self pointer and the list pointer (each instance has a pointer to its script).\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI also noticed some code, which seems to handle the case that the `instances` member contains placeholder instances. But based on the current code only objects with `GDScriptInstance`s are added, so I removed that part.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url